    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diyean iyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi diyeayda nea ghwadaambiir aba jeeda basooda, nea gwandeawa gujaw damanamughuush ea iheeni ispwa, ak gwanda shiip damanamughuush uhuuda gujakaaschi ak gwandeawa gheawunga giing'weaka aba iheenga gujakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea diyeaydida aadaayiin gawuurji mariirda, nea geeshangaaschi gawuurji idamooda, ak ghuutaanyi gawuurji ghuuta ng'adiida. Ak ghoadaw hararjooda diyeayda uurdaanyi ea hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda ea gheambalmeeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaadaayi uhuunagi aba iheengaaschi gawuurji gili mideawa dearjooda miyeeda, nea deaneadeadaanyi bea miyeeda ea nihaap, ak ghwaat geeshta diyeayda ng'eanyiisean aba muuwda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaghadoawan buuneeda ichiboodida, aba gideaba niidaw gheambalmeadaanyi diyeayda, hean ghaghadoawan diyeaydida nea gwayi, “Gawuurji ng'eaha diyeayda, ak gayghoamu ng'eaha gang'uchi sea niny?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geataw diyeayda ghuuta jea gabaloola ng'asheega hees bea giing'weaka, ak geataw gheambalmeeda jea gwasina gadiyeadaanyi sheeh haradam ea iyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwajaat ghuutaanyi goong'eawi ASEETA, nea goong'eawi eara gheawungaaschi ea heeda abiita, nea gea abiita humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesiksa gang'uchi sea fuga ghaydidi ak ghwajoar. Ak geataw gheambalmeeda aba badayda gilinyoo ea eemoochean gil ea buuneeda ea iita ea eemoojiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea haleanjeeda sean mida muunda ng'eanyiida gayghaghadoawan niny, giliwas sih miyeeng'oorsa gheawungaaschi jeeda gitaabooda eaweega bea Dayeenda Gisilleanda ghayi sinuus nea miyeebwat sindeeta ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo gwandeawa iita dayiinya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi diyeayda nuut siyeeng'u nea gwaleabu badayda ng'eanyiida; nea gwandeawa gujaw iyeenya nea gawuurji Dayeenda Gisilleanda ak gabaloolda ichibooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gagadiyeata gheambalmeedeaba diyeaydida bea madeedean iisidaah, ak ghwanung' ghoaghadoawan ng'eanyiida ea fuga mida jeeda diyeaydida bea madeedean, nea dearjoadaanyi bea miyeeda ea nihaap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gwadeagwajeega hees, nea iissa ghwanung' ghwararang'aana beasta humng'eeda ak ghwahidu ng'eanyi madeeda buuneeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea aba gwadeagwajeega siitaw gwasin aba madeeda diyeaydean, hean gwareengani fugiga mida ng'eanyiidean, ak ghwanung' gwasin giduurji diyeayda silasa ng'uta ak ea gudugwanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geanung' gaguusa jeameeda gidida uurji diyeaydean ak abeeda ghoamu gidida uurji diyeaydean gabalool, ak ghwanung' ealajaada gheatkweaka fuga mwaghadoawana gidida uurji diyeaydean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit gageanu sean fuga manang'i ea gea hees, fuga sean was meanang'oodiga ea gea barbari, sean fuga abal geat ea giing'oonyanga, ak geayiin giirooranga geatinda dugwa ghana gheamamuunatka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ea siida jea ghoamu ghwasha gil ghana ghwashaayda, geaghus gwandeawa giirooraneedida was gheawungeaba diyeaydideaniin, ghana mooneeda gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nih geeguura weaghuumeeda: ninyeeda mideawa fughareeda jea ghwanal ea dayiita mooneedeaba diyeanyi, nea nih ea gidiitiida buuneeda, nea mooneadaanyi ea bughalaji lah ea laadam ea lah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
